From 590ee5fc656b8a157f0de22833871ac3fd2afdf3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lunar <lunar@example.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 17:47:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] 1. Update the real state-as-action sidecar builder and
 Chinese docs so Spark action targets reuse state pose blocks while preserving
 raw gripper values. 2. Add a pi05_full warm-start option to reinitialize
 action expert modules after pretrained loading, covering gemma_expert and the
 action/time projection layers. 3. Wire the new action-expert-reset control
 through DLC pi05_full launchers, switch Spark TCP defaults to the v2
 transforms, and refresh related eval launchers.

